        <activityName xml:lang="en">Solar glass, low-iron, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Solar glass, low-iron, at regional storage
Assumption with inventory data for normal glass. This glass differes from normal glass mainly due to the type of raw materials, which is considered with a higher transport distance. Additional transports for importing it to Europe are included in the inventory.;
UUID: 4655e015-cfe3-3852-b4e5-3a2a62c61d5f
Gate to gate inventory for the process including transport to RER
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Estimation of low-iron glass production with technology used for normal flat glass.
Time period: Date of estimation.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Assumption 
Extrapolations: Assessment with European electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4655e015-cfe3-3852-b4e5-3a2a62c61d5f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
